      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.456,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.544
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "十月的一个晚上，她与宫本一起吃了一顿饭。",
      "sha256": "69c73120e76e2fca184489c86d6ab7e72de9732485bac1e2d0ae0ece065b4fb4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.656,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.344
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "饭后，两人回到她在京都的公寓。",
      "sha256": "6af1bb6a766bea7273d413724f9907f4c474a6c924cad6ba3e6b236d413a5cad",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.816,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.184
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "那天夜里，她的身体急剧变化。",
      "sha256": "bd45b058fd0828369790542d23694ff167cb30ebf2939cdb44515c5379e47916",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.888,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.112
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，10月12日，她的身体突然不适。",
      "sha256": "fc358f4509d42a0beb1d38a8887ee57e14093ebe4d3bc9ca177f19e15cdcbcc1",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.776,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.224
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，宫本没有叫救护车，而是联系了父母。",
      "sha256": "738afd106eee08fb94664b78f9ab6ee6ffe20b79caea925e96426e7e2997348b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.296,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.704
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "三天后，她在医院去世。",
      "sha256": "04cad9e2927b0c24172609b0e2c04c7044999a5f7da010b2903b9122390372ae",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 2.976,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 3.024
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "那一刻，病房里只剩下监护仪的声音。",
      "sha256": "df37ad748577db06c16b67d0d5f7c9f8324a56218651619cb4a067328756ae10",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.064,
      "atempo": 1.0128,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "转折出现在检验报告里：她的体内，检出了铊。",
      "sha256": "bb0b5233f83e9825b0ef7ff486a34c387b1b21e821bc598a08d4f913e4284d78",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.408,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.592
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "铊是一种剧毒金属，历史上曾被用于灭鼠。",
      "sha256": "d1145ee048df0198d63bd39872f09b33e8b0ca84c35b17c0e4019d03f5c68c02",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
